@startuml data-model
' Rendered with PlantUML's built-in Smetana layout (pure Java) so the SVG export
' needs no external Graphviz/dot install — reproducible in CI and on any machine.
!pragma layout smetana
' arc42 §5 — Persistence data model (data view) of the SteuerEule Postgres schema.
' Source of record for the diagram; export to data-model.svg (see README).
' Highlighted (green) = added by REQ-001 (steuereule#91/#92). Mirror of
' apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma — keep the two in step (stale arc42 = failing test).
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #6b7280

title SteuerEule — Persistence Data Model · arc42 §5 (data view)\ngreen = added by REQ-001 (Cockpit, steuereule#91/#92)

note as Nscope
  **userId is a logical scoping key, not a DB foreign key** (ADR-0007).
  There is no User table — identity is the guest-session / verified-session
  seam the UserContextGuard owns. Every row is read scoped to a single
  userId; there are no cross-user joins between these entities.
end note

class Profile {
  id : uuid <<PK>>
  userId : string <<unique>>
  firstName : string
  lastName : string
  steuerId : string <<encrypted>>
  steuernummer : string? <<encrypted>>
  createdAt : DateTime
  updatedAt : DateTime
}
note bottom of Profile
  steuerId / steuernummer are field-encrypted at rest
  (ADR-0008 — AES-256-GCM, per-write nonce, mode=strict).
  Plain facts only otherwise — clean side of the
  determinism boundary; @steuereule/core never recomputes these.
end note

class TaxDataAccessLog <<append-only>> {
  id : uuid <<PK>>
  userId : string <<indexed>>
  action : AuditAction (READ | WRITE)
  resource : string
  createdAt : DateTime
}
note bottom of TaxDataAccessLog
  DSGVO Art. 30 accountability trail (ADR-0008 / REQ-004).
  Who/what/when only — no value column, never the plaintext
  or ciphertext. Audited surface is identifier-class access
  (Profile), not read-of-own-estimate (Cockpit).
end note

class TaxYear #palegreen {
  id : uuid <<PK>>
  userId : string
  steuerjahr : int
  .. raw inputs only ..
  baseEstimate : int
  openItems : int
  openConflicts : int
  .. ..
  createdAt : DateTime
  updatedAt : DateTime
  __ unique (userId, steuerjahr) __
}
note bottom of TaxYear
  Stores **raw inputs only**. The Cockpit refund-estimate
  **range is never persisted** — recomputed on every read via
  @steuereule/core cockpitRange() (determinism boundary,
  ADR-014/048), so there is no second place to drift.
  No @encrypted field: ruled out of ADR-0008 scope (Musti
  review, R1a) — no tax identifier, only a rounded estimate
  and two counts. Revisit if assessed amounts / income land here.
end note

@enduml
